 ta. None sits above what its best price implies by its own bar (3 points o
 r more: the model's margin of error on that side)\, so there is no bet.\nI
 n a replay of past seasons these leans did not beat the closing price (NHL
  −4.8%\, NBA −7.9%\, NFL −9.5% ROI at the close). They become picks 
 when the live record beats the close.\nClosest to the bar:\n- NBA: Boston 
 Celtics ML -104 at BetRivers (+13.8 pts against a bar of +13.2 pts) · Bos
 ton Celtics @ Philadelphia 76ers\n- NHL: Over 5.5 -125 at DraftKings (+2.2
  pts against a bar of +3.0 pts) · Detroit Red Wings @ St Louis Blues\n- N
